<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union molasses import duties remain suspended, the sugar management committee decided on Wednesday, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;No change was made to molasses duties which continue to be suspended,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The reference price for cane molasses was reduced only slightly to 8.35 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 8.36 Ecus last week.</p>
<p>The reference price for beet molasses was reduced to 12.01 ecus per 100 kg from last week's figure of 12.20 ecus.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
